{"seq":46,"slug":"ada-safety-critical","title":"Ada 与安全攸关系统编程","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical","rating":{"composite":3.8,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ada-与安全攸关系统编程\">Ada 与安全攸关系统编程</h1><p>有一类软件，它的失效不会弹出一个错误对话框让你重试，而会让飞机失控、列车相撞、卫星失联。为这类系统编程，意味着「正确」不再是一种期望，而是一种必须被论证、被认证、被监管机构接受的工程属性。Ada 正是为这个世界而生的语言——它诞生于 1983 年美国国防部对语言碎片化的反击，从第一天起就把「不能出错」写进了设计目标，并经过四十余年的 ISO 标准化演进，至今仍是航电、轨道交通、航天领域的主力。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 想回答一个贯穿始终的问题：当软件失效意味着人命或巨额损失时，一门语言能为正确性提供什么样的保证？围绕它，全 hub 分四条主线层层递进。</p>\n<p>第一条主线是「基础」。它讲清 Ada 的地基：它的起源与在 C、C++、Rust 之间的独特定位，它把类型当作含义载体的强类型系统，以及它支撑百万行长生命周期工程的包与模块化结构。没有这块地基，后面的一切安全主张都无从谈起。</p>\n<p>第二条主线是「安全特性」。它是 Ada 区别于通用语言的核心：用契约式设计与 SPARK 把「测试代码」升级为「证明代码」，用 Ravenscar 把并发裁剪成可时序分析的确定性子集，用运行时检查与异常兜住静态保证够不到的地方。这三者构成同一安全主张从「证明」到「执行」的不同强度。</p>\n<p>第三条主线是「系统编程」。它打破「高级语言必然远离硬件」的误解：Ada 能用类型安全的方式做位操作与寄存器映射，能把实时调度的数学直接编进语言，能在没有垃圾回收的世界里写出内存安全的代码。安全攸关系统既要高层抽象，又要贴近硬件，这条主线展示 Ada 如何二者兼得。</p>\n<p>第四条主线是「工程实践」。再好的语言也要落地：DO-178C 这类认证标准如何定义「证明软件正确」的流程，GNAT 工具链如何把语言特性变成可用的生产力，C 互操作与 Ada 2022 又如何让 Ada 既能嵌入遗留系统、又能跟上语言的最新演进。</p>\n<p>四条主线不是孤立的章节，而是一座建筑的地基、承重墙、房间与屋顶。读完它们，你会理解的不只是一门语言的语法，而是一整套「如何让软件值得托付生命」的工程哲学。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"origins-and-positioning","title":"起源与定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/foundations/origins-and-positioning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"strong-type-system","title":"强类型系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/foundations/strong-type-system"},{"seq":3,"slug":"packages-and-modularity","title":"包与模块化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/foundations/packages-and-modularity"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"safety","title":"安全特性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/safety","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"design-by-contract-spark","title":"契约式设计与 SPARK","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/safety/design-by-contract-spark"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ravenscar-concurrency","title":"Ravenscar 并发模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/safety/ravenscar-concurrency"},{"seq":3,"slug":"runtime-checks-exceptions","title":"运行时检查与异常","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/safety/runtime-checks-exceptions"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"systems","title":"系统编程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"low-level-representation","title":"底层表示与硬件访问","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/systems/low-level-representation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"realtime-scheduling","title":"实时与调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/systems/realtime-scheduling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"memory-without-gc","title":"无 GC 的内存管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/systems/memory-without-gc"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"certification-do178c","title":"安全认证与 DO-178C","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/practice/certification-do178c"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gnat-toolchain","title":"GNAT 工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/practice/gnat-toolchain"},{"seq":3,"slug":"interop-and-ada2022","title":"C 互操作与 Ada 2022","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/ada-safety-critical/practice/interop-and-ada2022"}]}]}